  m_text: "The University of Turin preserves a vast archival heritage, with inventories
    progressively made available online in accordance with international standards.
    The Historical Archive gathers documents produced by the University\u2019s administrative
    offices, while records created by certain scientific institutes are kept within
    the institutions that inherited them.\n\nThe Museum\u2019s Archive is available
    online on the museum's website.\nTo consult materials in person, a reservation
    is required via email at museo.lombroso@unito.it\n\nMore than 2,600 letters written
    or received by Cesare Lombroso are accessible online through the #LombrosoProject
    portal. The collection includes around 800 outgoing letters and about 1,800 incoming
    letters, allowing for the virtual reconstruction of Lombroso\u2019s surviving
    correspondence.\n(The project was carried out by the University Museum System
    with the support of Fondazione CRT and the Department of Historical Studies of
    the University of Turin.)"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
